                <pb facs="0276" n="214" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg214"/>

                <head>No. 146.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Evarts to Mr. Taylor</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 3,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister, Berlin:</hi></p>
                <p>Express, through proper channel, the earnest congratulations of the President and
                    American people on His Majesty’s providential escape.</p>
                <closer><signed>EVARTS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
